{
  "kind": "gksa13-e2e-capture-example",
  "captureVersion": 1,
  "_note": [
    "SCHEMA EXAMPLE ONLY — THIS FILE IS NOT EVIDENCE.",
    "Its kind is deliberately not 'gksa13-e2e-capture', so tests/e2e/verify.py",
    "rejects it as an unsupported schema. Do not treat this file as a passing",
    "capture; the validator never generates a capture and never marks a scenario",
    "passed.",
    "This file exists so the negative check can prove that an unexecuted example",
    "is rejected instead of silently accepted.",
    "Copy this file to a capture whose kind is 'gksa13-e2e-capture' and fill every",
    "REPLACE placeholder from a real Proton run before validating.",
    "The popup uses the game's native titled dialog. Keep the title region separate:",
    "an empty title records a native error log. gksr.popup.sermon.body is a two-",
    "paragraph sentence; record the rendered plain text with the two paragraphs",
    "separated by a blank line; the Huly source emphasis tags are layout-only and",
    "must not appear in the observed text.",
    "Only the loaded slot identity (slotName, isDemoSave, slot-generation) is captured",
    "immutably and frozen for the load. absoluteDay is read fresh at every trigger",
    "evaluation, so a next sermon cycle within the same load uses the current date.",
    "Never use a display name (native SaveSlotData has no user-editable display-name",
    "field), a timestamp, the platform, or a latest-slot guess.",
    "All scenarios in tests/e2e/gksa13.json are UNEXECUTED. This example describes",
    "no run and contains no measured value."
  ],
